   }
  },
  "-752022701": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -182816597,
   "actor": "Gabriel",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Have a safe drive home!",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-900968269": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1917417706,
   "actor": "Gabriel",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "You’re actually the first. I’ve always wanted to mentor someone.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1963288893": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 354056752,
   "actor": "Gabriel",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I am not, but my wife is. She...",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-188145124": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1270408850,
   "actor": "Haniya",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Do you want to tell the story?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2105977516": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -801684138,
   "actor": "Gabriel",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Well, to be honest, most of the wealth comes from Haniya’s side of the family.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1256439296": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -801684138,
   "actor": "Haniya",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Yes, my family has been very fortunate over the years.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "734496301": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1917417706,
   "actor": "Haniya",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Gabriel’s very selective. He sees something special in you, which is why he’s offering to mentor you. It’s a big deal.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-2006432887": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1917417706,
   "actor": "Gabriel",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I’m excited to see where this journey takes us. I believe you have what it takes to go far.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "star"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "987735346": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 354056752,
   "actor": "Haniya",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I can speak for myself, Gabriel.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2005223276": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1270408850,
   "actor": "Gabriel",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": " We met at a charity auction. I had donated a couple of my photographs to be auctioned off, and Haniya was there representing a local charity.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-923945354": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 354056752,
   "actor": "Haniya",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I’m a devout Muslim, and my faith guides me every day.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1491914372": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 354056752,
   "actor": "Haniya",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "It’s a big part of who I am, and Gabriel has always been supportive of that.",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "star"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2009407634": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1270408850,
   "actor": "Haniya",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Yes, and I was so determined to get one of his pieces. I ended up in a bidding war with another guest and won. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-831031478": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1270408850,
   "actor": "Haniya",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Afterwards, I went to thank him for the beautiful photo, and we got to talking.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "695423920": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1270408850,
   "actor": "Gabriel",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "We spent the entire evening chatting about photography, our passions, and life in general. There was an instant connection.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1168848667": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1270408850,
   "actor": "Haniya",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "And he was kind enough to offer me a private tour of his studio the next day. ",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "star"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1675428606": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -801684138,
   "actor": "Gabriel",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I’ve made a decent living with my photography, but it’s Haniya’s family that’s provided a lot of our financial stability.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "827452770": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -801684138,
   "actor": "Haniya",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "And Gabriel has contributed so much in other ways. His talent and passion are invaluable. ",
   "jump": {
    "mode": "Jump",
    "to": "star"
   },
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
